      'The Devine formula was published in 1974 and estimates IBW from height and sex using a base weight at 5 feet plus a fixed amount per additional inch. It is widely used in clinical pharmacology and drug dosing.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Which IBW formula is used most often in clinical practice?',
    answer:
